flowchart TD
    A([Power On / Reset]) --> B["Configure pins:\nA0=TPS, A1=FPS, A2=IAT, A3=ET\nD3=pump PWM, D4=injector\nD8=ICP, D12=green LED, D13=red LED"]
    B --> C[Init Timer1 for CKPS input capture on D8\nfalling edge trigger]
    C --> D[Init Timer2 for pump PWM on D3]
    D --> E[Init Serial port]
    E --> F[Load injection map 12x5 from EEPROM]
    F --> G[Load PID coefficients Kp/Ki/Kd from EEPROM]
    G --> H[Load target pressure table from EEPROM]
    H --> I[Light green LED solid → system initialized]
    I --> J([Enter Main Loop])
